WEBVTT

00:00.739 --> 00:02.574
Tayari umeshajua kwamba

00:02.574 --> 00:04.768
kuzidisha ni sawa na kurudia kujumlisha.

00:04.768 --> 00:08.894
Kwa hiyo, kama tulikuwa na 2 mara 3 (2 × 3), hii ni sawa na

00:08.894 --> 00:11.828
mbili ziwe tatu kisha uzijumlishe

00:11.828 --> 00:16.645
kwa hiyo ingekuwa 2 + 2 + 2.

00:16.645 --> 00:20.270
Kumbuka hii ni [KUJUMLISHA: 1, 2] mbili mbili 3

00:20.270 --> 00:24.736
Na ukizijumlisha hizo 2 pamoja, unapata 6.

00:24.736 --> 00:26.376
Somo la leo katika hii video litahusu

00:26.376 --> 00:30.659
kurudia kuzidisha--

00:30.659 --> 00:32.601
njia mpya ambayo

00:32.601 --> 00:34.336
inaitwa kurudia kuzidisha.

00:34.336 --> 00:39.544
Ni njia ya kuchukua 'kipeo'

00:39.544 --> 00:41.675
Inafurahisha.

00:41.675 --> 00:42.958
Lakini tutaona kwa kutumia

00:42.958 --> 00:44.659
mifano michache

00:44.659 --> 00:46.635
Kwa hiyo, sasa hivi tutafute

00:46.635 --> 00:50.104
2 kipeo cha tatu (2^3) –

00:50.104 --> 00:51.097
ni sawa na kusema hivyo.

00:51.097 --> 00:52.045
Ngoja niandike

00:52.045 --> 00:53.713
kwa rangi husika

00:53.713 --> 00:57.537
Kwa hiyo 2 kipeo cha 3. (2^3.)

00:57.537 --> 00:59.026
Unaweza kushawishika kusema,

00:59.026 --> 01:01.491
'Labda hii ni 2 × 3, ambayo jibu lake ni 6.'

01:01.491 --> 01:02.553
Lakini kumbuka, Nimesema

01:02.553 --> 01:04.527
hii ni kurudia kuzidisha.

01:04.527 --> 01:07.196
Kwa hiyo kama nina 2 kipeo cha 3, (2^3),

01:07.196 --> 01:11.065
hii ina maana kurudia kuzidisha 2 mara tatu

01:11.065 --> 01:15.013
Hivyo ni sawa na,

01:15.013 --> 01:18.510
lakini siyo 2 + 2 + 2, lakini 2x...

01:18.510 --> 01:20.538
(Natumia nukta kumaanisha alama ya kuzidisha)

01:20.538 --> 01:24.276
... 2 × 2 × 2.

01:24.276 --> 01:27.202
2 × 2 × 2 ni ngapi?

01:27.202 --> 01:29.230
jibu ni 8.

01:29.230 --> 01:31.365
(2 × 2 × 2 = 8.)

01:31.365 --> 01:35.268
Kwa hiyo 2 kipeo cha 3 ni sawa na 8. (2^3 = 8.)

01:35.268 --> 01:37.813
Tufanye mifano mingine zaidi hapa.

01:37.813 --> 01:45.598
3 kipeo cha 2

01:45.598 --> 01:47.183
(3^2) ni ngapi?

01:47.183 --> 01:48.970
Hebu jaribu kuifanya kwanza

01:48.970 --> 01:51.454
nakusihi simamisha video kwanza.

01:51.454 --> 01:52.829
Sasa hebu tufanye.

01:52.829 --> 01:58.084
Hii ina maana urudie kuizidisha 3 mara 2

01:58.084 --> 02:00.573
Tuzidishe 3 mara--

02:00.573 --> 02:02.810
(Ngoja niandike kwa rangi ya njano.)

02:02.810 --> 02:07.093
Tuzidishe 3 × 3.

02:07.093 --> 02:11.197
Jibu litakuwa ni 9.

02:11.197 --> 02:12.979
Tufanye mifano mingine zaidi.

02:12.979 --> 02:19.938
Je 5 kipeo---

02:19.938 --> 02:23.421
5 kipeo cha 4 ni ngapi (5^4)?

02:23.421 --> 02:24.212
Utakachokiona hapa ni kwamba

02:24.212 --> 02:25.378
hii namba itazidi kuongezeka

02:25.378 --> 02:27.635
haraka sana.

02:27.635 --> 02:30.090
Kwa hiyo 5 kipeo cha 4 (5^4) itakuwa

02:30.090 --> 02:33.399
ni sawa na kurudia kuizidisha 5 mara 4

02:33.399 --> 02:38.649
kwa hiyo 5^4 = 5 × 5 × 5 × 5.

02:38.649 --> 02:40.822
Kumbuka, tunatakiwa [kuhesabau: 1, 2, 3] 4 yaani 5 ziwe 4.

02:40.822 --> 02:42.110
Kisha tunazizidisha.

02:42.110 --> 02:42.971
Hatuzijumlishi.

02:42.971 --> 02:44.416
siyo sawa na 5 × 4.

02:44.416 --> 02:45.668
Siyo 20.

02:45.668 --> 02:47.962
Inatakiwa kuwa 5 × 5 × 5 × 5.

02:47.962 --> 02:49.658
Jibu litakuwa ngapi?

02:49.658 --> 02:52.413
Vizuri 5 × 5 ni 25. (5 × 5 = 25.)

02:52.413 --> 02:56.573
25 × 5 ni 125. (25 × 5 = 125.)

02:56.573 --> 03:01.531
125 × 5 ni 625. (125 × 5 = 625.)
